OL,3,GNEWSAPopular snooker club's move backed
OL,4,Aby council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular snooker club's move to a new
OL,7,Fhome has won the backing of council
OL,8,Fbosses.
OL,10,FThe Hustler Pool and Snooker Club in
OL,11,FNewcastle city centre closed its doors
OL,12,Fearlier this year, ahead of the planned
OL,13,Fdemolition of the vacant Hadrian House
OL,14,Fblock.
OL,16,FThe club had operated in the city
OL,17,Fcentre for almost 50 years, leaving its
OL,18,Fregulars upset, but the club
OL,19,Fsubsequently announced it was hoping to
OL,20,Freopen in a new base.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
