OL,3,GNEWSAPopular snooker club's move backed
OL,4,Aby council
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle City Council granted planning
OL,7,Fpermission for the former Newcastle
OL,8,FLabour Club, next to Haymarket Metro
OL,9,Fstation in the city centre, to be
OL,10,Fturned into a pool and snooker hall.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
